# docker/.env — the compose PROJECT-directory env file.
#
# Copy to docker/.env (gitignored) and fill in for THIS machine. Compose
# interpolates "${VAR:-...}" expressions in the compose files from this file
# (or the shell environment); it is a DIFFERENT mechanism from `env_file:
# - ../.env`, which injects the repository-root .env into the container
# verbatim. A variable that is only in ../.env never reaches `environment:`
# interpolation, and `environment:` overrides `env_file:` per key — so the
# variables below must live here, not in the root .env.
#
# No committed file ever carries a secret VALUE (AGENTS.md §13a): credentials
# are referenced by name, and the value lives only in this machine-local file
# or in an environment's secret management.

# =============================================================================
# Provider credentials (agent runtime)
# =============================================================================
# OpenRouter API key — paid tier for openrouter/* models; empty = free
# opencode/zen tier only. opencode inside the server container reads
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY from its inherited environment. OPENCODE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY
# is the platform-prefixed twin; leave it empty and compose defaults it to the
# canonical value — set it only to deliberately diverge the two.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
OPENCODE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=

# =============================================================================
# Secret custody substrate (ADR 0018 documented fallback)
# =============================================================================
# Which secret provider the server resolves credentials through. Empty = the
# local secret store under SHIPIT_LOCAL_SECRET_DIR (fail-closed at runtime).
SHIPIT_SECRET_PROVIDER=
# HOST path bind-mounted to /var/lib/shipit/secrets in the server container
# (git deploy-key private halves). Unset falls back to a deliberately bad
# /tmp path so a lost variable lands somewhere obviously wrong.
SHIPIT_HOST_SECRET_DIR=

# =============================================================================
# Durable product workspace
# =============================================================================
# HOST path bind-mounted to /workspace-repo in the server container — the
# durable, reviewer-readable product clone root (decision 9bfe2d09).
SHIPIT_HOST_WORKSPACE_DIR=
# One-shot boot instruction (JSON) telling the server to clone one product's
# repository into the durable workspace. Normally EMPTY — a no-op.
SHIPIT_PROVISION_DURABLE_WORKSPACE=

# =============================================================================
# Operator / concurrency settings
# =============================================================================
# Concurrent agent execution cap for the server (compose default is 2 for QA;
# fails closed if the CONTAINER var is missing entirely — this entry only
# overrides the default).
SHIPIT_DISPATCH_MAX_CONCURRENT_AGENTS=
# Client (nginx) service values — operator-asserted, empty = "unconfigured".
SHIPIT_HOST_KEY_FINGERPRINT=
SHIPIT_OPERATOR_NAME=
